<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NUI upped to long-term buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NUI upped to long-term buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Friday it had raised its rating for Nui Corp to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept its near-term rating for the company of accumulate.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
